1
00:00:00,196 --> 00:00:01,566
(Raj:)He's right.

2
00:00:01,564 --> 00:00:03,734
(Raj:)If you think about it,
we're all in charge.

3
00:00:03,733 --> 00:00:05,303
(Sheldon:)No, the guy in charge is in...

4
00:00:05,301 --> 00:00:08,101
(Sheldon:)Why is everyone so bad
at these?!

5
00:00:09,404 --> 00:00:11,234
(Penny:)I mean, the whole experience
reminded me

6
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,410
(Penny:)about how much
I hated about that world.

7
00:00:13,409 --> 00:00:15,809
You-you know, the anxiety,
the depression, the negativity.

8
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:17,811
(Penny:)I don't want
to feel those things.

9
00:00:17,813 --> 00:00:22,113
(Penny:)I want to sell drugs to people
who feel those things.

10
00:00:22,118 --> 00:00:24,318
(Amy:)I can't believe you got up
and walked out

11
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,550
(Amy:)of an audition for a big movie.

12
00:00:26,555 --> 00:00:27,885
(Leonard:)I did.

13
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:29,690
I-I mean, I walked in,
read for the part,

14
00:00:29,692 --> 00:00:31,962
(Penny:)then stunk up the place,
but then I walked right out.

15
00:00:32,994 --> 00:00:34,264
(Bernadette:)Well, I'm glad

16
00:00:34,263 --> 00:00:36,233
(Bernadette:)you have a new
appreciation for your job.

17
00:00:36,232 --> 00:00:38,002
(Penny:)I do, and you know,
I don't think

18
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,100
(Penny:)I've ever thanked you properly
for helping me get it.

19
00:00:40,102 --> 00:00:41,932
(Bernadette:)Properly, at all.

20
00:00:41,937 --> 00:00:44,977
(Bernadette:)It's just words
I've never heard.

21
00:00:44,974 --> 00:00:46,144
(Raj:)Well, thank you.

22
00:00:46,142 --> 00:00:48,242
(Penny:)You're a good friend,
and you changed my life.

23
00:00:48,244 --> 00:00:49,914
(Bernadette:)You're welcome.

24
00:00:49,912 --> 00:00:51,542
(Bernadette:)Hey, now that
you're making some real money,

25
00:00:51,547 --> 00:00:54,017
(Bernadette:)maybe you can take your friend
out for a nice thank-you dinner.

26
00:00:54,016 --> 00:00:56,616
(Howard:)Sure.

27
00:00:56,619 --> 00:00:58,389
(Amy:)And you probably have
to invite your other friend

28
00:00:58,387 --> 00:00:59,757
(Amy:)'cause she overheard you
talking about it,

29
00:00:59,755 --> 00:01:01,825
(Amy:)and it would be awkward
to exclude her.

30
00:01:01,824 --> 00:01:03,754
(Leonard:)Okay.

31
00:01:03,759 --> 00:01:04,859
(Bernadette:)How about now?

32
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:06,990
(Sheldon:)All right.

33
00:01:09,297 --> 00:01:10,827
(Bernadette:)Don't forget your wallet.

34
00:01:10,833 --> 00:01:12,863
I... (groans)

35
00:01:21,076 --> 00:01:23,476
(Sheldon(on screen):)Greetings from planet Earth.

36
00:01:25,246 --> 00:01:27,316
(Sheldon(on screen):)Just turn left
at Alpha Centauri.

37
00:01:27,316 --> 00:01:29,216
(Sheldon(on screen):)You can't miss it.

